      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 7.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "Okay, doctor, we're all set in here. I'll give you the numbers when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.62,
      "end_seconds": 16.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.62,
      "end_seconds": 26.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "mainly I've been losing my sense of smell that's why I came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.38,
      "end_seconds": 32.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "When did this begin? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.26,
      "end_seconds": 36.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "it's been about two weeks now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.58,
      "end_seconds": 40.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "how much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.32,
      "end_seconds": 47.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Severe, really. There's a dull pressure over my face as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.69,
      "end_seconds": 54.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "So, tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.84,
      "end_seconds": 60.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.84,
      "end_seconds": 62.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.25,
      "end_seconds": 67.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.48,
      "end_seconds": 70.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.59,
      "end_seconds": 75.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.01,
      "end_seconds": 80.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.77,
      "end_seconds": 84.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Saline spray, three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.7,
      "end_seconds": 91.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Right, are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.8,
      "end_seconds": 93.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.25,
      "end_seconds": 109.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.78,
      "end_seconds": 113.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "no, never"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.25,
      "end_seconds": 120.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.02,
      "end_seconds": 125.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Let me think, no, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.46,
      "end_seconds": 147.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Alright, what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.47,
      "end_seconds": 151.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "my father has Parkinson's disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.82,
      "end_seconds": 173.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "okay, have you noticed nosebleeds or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.64,
      "end_seconds": 177.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "no nosebleeds or fever, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.1,
      "end_seconds": 180.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "and your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.64,
      "end_seconds": 183.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.2,
      "end_seconds": 187.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.64,
      "end_seconds": 190.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 191.61,
      "end_seconds": 200.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 86, temp 36.9 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pressure 116 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.27,
      "end_seconds": 203.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.61,
      "end_seconds": 209.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.4,
      "end_seconds": 212.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.64,
      "end_seconds": 228.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "There are pale, grape-like swellings inside both nostrils."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.63,
      "end_seconds": 234.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.84,
      "end_seconds": 272.01,
      "duration_seconds": 30.17,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It's hard to say. Nasal polyps is one possibility and chronic sinusitis another, and I'd rather not commit yet. I'd like to arrange a nasal endoscopy for nasal obstruction. The treatment will be mometasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, two sprays each side once a day, eight weeks. It's for Nasal polyps. Rinse with saline and use the spray daily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.77,
      "end_seconds": 294.34,
      "duration_seconds": 21.57,
      "text": "make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest the ENT clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse come back in eight weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.24,
      "end_seconds": 296.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.81,
      "end_seconds": 301.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.99,
      "end_seconds": 305.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.71,
      "end_seconds": 308.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
